\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299440\n", "files": ["media/libvorbis/0001-alloca-to-malloc-in-vorbis_book_init_decode.patch", "media/libvorbis/0002-null-checks-in-vorbis_book_init_decode.patch", "media/libvorbis/lib/vorbis_sharedbook.c", "media/libvorbis/moz.yaml"], "git_node": "7575274aa89131a6aae294a5f15bf99b53b25b6d", "git_parents": ["2b247104529204a99030db0614af85c20442a829"], "node": "20e563726f0c8ca3ea68ae09cef48c2125248ff9", "parents": ["391742a529fc12ff1af22e25bb7d336c41323dc1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1778336898, "git_changesets": ["7575274aa89131a6aae294a5f15bf99b53b25b6d"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1157": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas B. Pierron \u003cnicolas.b.pierron@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2036978 - Increase RecoverOffset size.  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299169\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299525\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/IonTypes.h", "js/src/jit/Snapshots.cpp", "js/src/jit/Snapshots.h"], "git_node": "deedb918a317f476e41f3bb826c78723ae4c6e51", "git_parents": ["7575274aa89131a6aae294a5f15bf99b53b25b6d"], "node": "f3795dcae8d3a006024df8ecd95bbc3e699efd20", "parents": ["20e563726f0c8ca3ea68ae09cef48c2125248ff9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1778359480, "git_changesets": ["deedb918a317f476e41f3bb826c78723ae4c6e51"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1158": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2037875 - formatURIForDisplay should display formatted IDN URIs instead of punycode if omitting subdomains,  ,mossop  a=dmeehan\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299155\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299491\n", "files": ["toolkit/modules/BrowserUtils.sys.mjs", "toolkit/modules/tests/xpcshell/test_BrowserUtils_urlFormatting.js"], "git_node": "8b21e82d805594df54365aaa446c451e7fee2df4", "git_parents": ["deedb918a317f476e41f3bb826c78723ae4c6e51"], "node": "f875cd64ed1af0c6b70c8f336fc2c142c333e113", "parents": ["f3795dcae8d3a006024df8ecd95bbc3e699efd20"], "tags": []}], "date": 1778359740, "git_changesets": ["8b21e82d805594df54365aaa446c451e7fee2df4"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1159": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lars Eggert \u003clars@eggert.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2017274 - Fix intermittent timeout in test_http3_alt_svc.js  a=dmeehan DONTBUILD\n\nHTTP3Server.start() returned undefined when its regex failed to match server\noutput, causing test_https_alt_svc to poll indefinitely against an invalid\nroute. Fix by throwing on unexpected output, handling server start failures in\n.catch handlers, bounding the alt-svc polling loop with MAX_POLL_RETRIES, and\nadding a timeout to the speculative connect observer.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D293815\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299574\n", "files": ["netwerk/test/unit/head_servers.js", "netwerk/test/unit/test_http3_alt_svc.js"], "git_node": "dd4dbf611fc5f96daa2260edd80f97ff372b965f", "git_parents": ["8b21e82d805594df54365aaa446c451e7fee2df4"], "node": "82bcc26bc0f8e1541166d5e1f2ddcb5028b677d4", "parents": ["f875cd64ed1af0c6b70c8f336fc2c142c333e113"], "tags": []}], "date": 1778421825, "git_changesets": ["dd4dbf611fc5f96daa2260edd80f97ff372b965f"], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "1160": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2028319, part 1 - Make IsDataInBuffer into a regular method.  a=dmeehan\n\nIt is only called in one place. This makes later changes simpler.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298569\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299593\n", "files": ["dom/xul/nsXULContentSink.cpp", "dom/xul/nsXULContentSink.h"], "git_node": "31376a301953036d6480e77881f36648417fad9e", "git_parents": ["dd4dbf611fc5f96daa2260edd80f97ff372b965f"], "node": "a312ccab8e30de19c710258aa194c82364737290", "parents": ["82bcc26bc0f8e1541166d5e1f2ddcb5028b677d4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2028319, part 2 - Convert XULContentSinkImpl::mText to an nsTArray, and make AddText take a Span.  a=dmeehan\n\nmTextSize becomes mText.Capacity().\nmTextLength becomes mText.Length().\n\nConvert various variables to size_t for consistency.\n\nnsTArray internally uses some kind of fancy growth strategy, so the memory usage\nwon't be exactly the same, but hopefully that doesn't matter. The way it\ninternally tracks length and capacity like we need is very convenient.\n\nSkip the end of the loop if there is no space remaining, because it won't do\nanything. To make things clearer, don't calculate how many characters are to be\ncopied until we've determined that there is still space.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D298570\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299594\n", "files": ["dom/xul/nsXULContentSink.cpp", "dom/xul/nsXULContentSink.h"], "git_node": "e375dc448a734ffdef7905e2d7de4d7b4dab6fa3", "git_parents": ["31376a301953036d6480e77881f36648417fad9e"], "node": "5dbef8c55263fff317cb74909c537b2b84d854b9", "parents": ["a312ccab8e30de19c710258aa194c82364737290"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2028319, part 3 - Convert nsXMLContentSink::mText to an AutoTArray, and make AddText take a Span.  a=dmeehan\n\nBasically a simpler version of the previous patch.\n\nNS_ACCUMULATION_BUFFER_SIZE becomes mText.Capacity().\nmTextLength becomes mText.Length().\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299215\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D299595\n", "files": ["dom/xml/nsXMLC